# Changelogs are generated by changesets in a markdown style that the CI format
# gate (`oxfmt --check`) rejects. oxfmt honors .gitignore, so this makes it skip
# them. They stay git-tracked (already committed) and are still updated on release.
**/CHANGELOG.md
